      "alt": "MBa8MPxL Single Board Computer",
      "text": "<h1>Single Board Computer (SBC) based on TQMa8MPxL</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Single Board Computer (SBC) MBa8MPxL is a versatile solution for embedded computing engineers. Based on the TQMa8MPxL module, it features an Arm® Cortex®-A53 processor and offers advanced audio capabilities with HiFi4 DSP. Key features include a Machine Learning Accelerator, I2x CAN FD, digital input/output options, high-speed communication via 2x Gbit Ethernet, 1x PCIe, and 2x USB 3.0 interfaces. The MBa8MPxL embedded single board computer (SBC) maintains low power consumption (typically 4 W) and integrates essential security functions. Its compact size and numerous interfaces make it suitable for a wide range of industrial applications.</p>\r\n",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 18:11:46 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
